  // markStateKeys / vKey) to preserve exact behavior; meet2 no longer borrows nucleosomeParser.pfCanonKey.
  // NOTE: canonNegatives keys off a SCALAR pf.certainty (v1 schema); v2 proteoforms carry piecewise
  // segment certainty, so pf.certainty is absent → the native branch runs (current behavior). The
